{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultimate 2D Shooter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rat with an assault rifle? How about a rat with <i>TWENTY</i> guns \u2014 including shotguns, energy weapons, grenade launchers, an overpowered harpoon gun, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/extras/c0db6b22cc25df0952dc7a1e604564c9.poster.avif?t=1752598917\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/extras/c0db6b22cc25df0952dc7a1e604564c9.webm?t=1752598917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/extras/c0db6b22cc25df0952dc7a1e604564c9.mp4?t=1752598917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Spells and Perks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns not enough? That\u2019s fair. That\u2019s why GAT RAT can also wield elemental spells and game-changing perks that completely transform your playstyle into something wild and overpowered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/extras/4aaadf5bbe46339374ce0c08291415e2.poster.avif?t=1752598917\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/extras/4aaadf5bbe46339374ce0c08291415e2.webm?t=1752598917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661740/extras/4aaadf5bbe46339374ce0c08291415e2.mp4?t=1752598917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Pixel Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot your way through 9 vastly different realms, each packed with multiple levels, unique enemies, and intense boss fights \u2014 all rendered in beautiful pixel art, just waiting to be destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAT RAT Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 guns</strong>, each with their own feel and strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 unique spells</strong> to excel in different scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 perks</strong> to turn GAT RAT into the ultimate shooter. (Or spellcaster. Or brick wall.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect loot</strong> from slain enemies, and return to your hideout to upgrade your gear and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 vastly different realms</strong>, each with multiple levels of their own, complete with a massive variety of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique boss fights</strong> that each require their own strategy to beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful, immersive pixel art</strong> for every world and enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> for fastest boss clears and\u00a0lifetime collected loot \u2014 build the best loadout and show everyone who the greatest is.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gun Nut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661740/5db4a115d700e497e82be1551956de6fffb51208.jpg"},{"name":"Wizard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661740/4e958562e38d34190d830ac088d2040f69c35bbd.jpg"},{"name":"Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity